DESCRIPTION:Join us for the FREE V-Town Community Connect Fair\, hosted by
  a local Leadership Vallejo group. This event is all about bringing people
  together and showing love to the community!\n\nCome out and:\n\n✨ Enjoy
  delicious tacos & live DJ music\n\n🤝 Connect with local nonprofits and
  community partners\n\n🌱 Discover resources\, programs\, and opportunit
 ies available to you\n\n💬 Build meaningful relationships with your neig
