BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Quench at Copia: The Mount "Crushmore" of American Wine
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260513T183000
UID:2604307FmVQBdwVUCiQJ8snPUbtg
DESCRIPTION:Be a part of the LIVE studio audience in the Napa Valley Vintn
 ers Theatre at the CIA at Copia! Master Sommelier Andrea Immer Robinson ta
 kes her newest podcast series\, Quench at Copia\, to another level with sp
 ecial guest experts and YOU in the audience!\n\nThis month\, Andrea will b
 e taking us through the renowned Judgment of Paris of 1976 as part of our 
 50th Anniversary Celebration\, when Napa Valley became a global icon. You'
 ll taste the winning wines from the original competition along with comple
 mentary bites and a sample dish from The Grove restaurant.\n\n**This is no
 t a standard wine tasting. This is a masterclass in gastronomy.**\n\nWhile
  Napa offers hundreds of tasting experiences throughout the Valley\, it is
  almost unheard of to have direct\, intimate access to talent of this cali
 ber in a single evening. This is your opportunity to bypass the standard t
 asting room script and learn directly from seasoned hospitality profession
 als.\n\nMore details to follow.
LOCATION:CIA at Copia
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/quench-at-copia-the-mount-crushmore-of-am
 erican-wine-tickets-1985410580492?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
