SUMMARY:Safari West Presents! Cheetah Conservation Fund
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T203000
UID:260508rdZgAQxYc0GEb1r8EXfO9A
DESCRIPTION:Conservation Dinner Series: Laurie Marker of  Cheetah Conserva
 tion Fund joins us in the elephant room after dinner to give a talk about 
 saving the cheetah. The evening begins at 6:00 PM with VIP cocktails and a
  silent auction fundraiser followed by a conservation dinner at 7:00 PM fo
 r $45 and Dr. Marker's lecture at 8:00 PM. If you want to attend this pres
 entation\, please call our reservations team at \\(707\\) 566-3667 or \\(8
 00\\) 616-2695 and they can book it for you. Dinner starts at 7:00 PM.   A
 bout the Speaker Dr. Marker of the Cheetah Conservation Fund\, \\(CCF\\) h
 as dedicated her life to studying cheetahs and preserving their way of lif
 e. She founded the not-for-profit Cheetah Conservation Fund in 1990 and mo
 ved to Namibia\, developing a permanent Conservation Research Centre for t
 he wild cheetah. In 2000\, Dr. Marker was recognized as one of the "Heroes
  for the Planet" by Time Magazine. She also received the prestigious Burro
 w's Conservation Award. Dr. Marker was also featured as Person of the Week
  on ABC's Charlie Gibson show. We are honored to have her visit Safari Wes
 t for our staff\, guests\, and friends.
LOCATION:Safari West
URL:https://www.safariwest.com/calendar/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
