BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cancer Support - Mindfulness Hour (Zoom)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260514T130000
UID:260510DJ8IROGqXEKdF3S1PTJU8g
DESCRIPTION:The Cancer Support Community provides support\, education\, an
 d hope for families touched by cancer. Mindfulness Hour is offered twice m
 onthly at no cost as one of their services . Research shows that mindfulne
 ss is a highly effective tool in managing stress and discomfort. It will h
 elp you become more present\, aware\, less reactive and overwhelmed. Come 
 spend an hour with us\, learning about concepts of mindfulness\, distress 
 tolerance\, and emotional regulation. Each session will be led by Dee DiGi
 oia\, which will include a 10-15 minute guided meditation to ensure an opp
 ortunity for participants to practice together. WHAT: Mindfulness Hour - C
 ancer Support Community \\(open to anyone impacted by cancer\\) WHEN: Thur
 sday\, May 9 / 12:00 - 1:00 pm  WHERE: on Zoom - to Join the online Zoom M
 eeting PLEASE RSVP: If you are a current Participant and would like to joi
 n this group\, please click on this link to be taken to your member portal
 . From there you will see an option to click on "Your Groups" and a drop d
 own menu will open the option to click on "All Groups". You can add yourse
 lf to any of the Healthy Lifestyle Programs by clicking the \\+ sign and t
 hen "Join Group". If you are NOT a current participant and would like to b
 e added\, or if you have any questions\, please call 805-238-4411 or send 
 an email: programs@cscslo.org. You can also access the Zoom at the Cancer 
 Support Community\, Templeton 1051 Las Tablas Rd.\, Templeton\, CA 93446 P
 hone: 805-238-4411     Website: cscslo.org  MORE CANCER SUPPORT OFFERINGS:
  Resilience Sound Journeys for Cancer Support Therapeutic wellness experie
 nces for anyone touched by cancer — offering care\, renewal\, and gentle
  support for patients\, survivors\, caregivers\, families\, healthcare pro
 viders\, and those navigating post-cancer healing or loss. FREE Series spo
 nsored by Adventist Health 1- Sierra Vista\, San Luis Obispo SATURDAYS ~ M
 ay 9 / July 11 / Sept 12 / Nov 14 10:00 AM to 11:00 AM with light refreshm
 ents afterwards  2- Cancer Support Community\, Templeton WEDNESDAYS  ~  Ju
 ne 17 / Aug 19 / Oct 21 / Dec 16 5:00 PM to 6:00 PM with light refreshment
 s afterwards  Registration links found here: my805tix.com/profile/mindful-
 kindful-youniversity  Questions?  Contact Dee DiGioia\, Mindful Kindful YO
 University Call or text 805-270-5523  Public and private events offered th
 roughout San Luis Obispo County EVENT CALENDAR   /   SUBSCRIBE Dee DiGioia
 \, founder of Mindful Kindful YOUniversity\, is a Certified Therapeutic So
 und Practitioner\, HealthRhythms Drumming Wellness Facilitator\, Mindfulne
 ss-Meditation Teacher\, Grief Educator\, and Nature Connection Guide \\(Sh
 inrin Yoku–Forest Bathing\\). More About Dee.
URL:https://www.my805tix.com/e/mindfulness-hour-may-9/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
