DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260515T210000
UID:2601138v1AyKkwM0eADaBb_wocVw
DESCRIPTION:Sound Sessions is our monthly Friday night series where the fo
 rmat changes but the vibe stays the same: welcoming\, unpretentious\, and 
 all about bringing people together through music.\n\nYour stage. Your voic
 e. Your community. May’s Sound Sessions opens the floor to local perform
 ers\, poets\, singers\, storytellers\, and anyone with something to share.
  This is your chance to try out new material\, share your art\, or finally
  do that thing you’ve been thinking about doing.\n\nSign up for a 5-7 mi
 nute slot when you arrive. Bring your acoustic guitar\, your poetry notebo
 ok\, comedy set or spoken word- whatever form your creativity takes. Perfo
 rming or just here to support? Either way\, you’re part of creating some
 thing special!
LOCATION:The Exchange
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/sound-sessions-open-mic
 -night/17833325/2026-05-15T19
