BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Enhance Family History with Vintage Postcards
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T143000
UID:260508Xm_-UQghYUaEXe5ffZdUdA
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma County Genealogical Society Presents\n\n Enhance F
 amily History with Vintage Postcards\n\nPresented by: Alice van Ommeren\n\
 n Vintage postcards are the perfect medium for enhancing your family gene
 alogy. They are accessible\, affordable\, and cover thousands of subjects.
  More importantly\, they document glimpses of life as far back as the 1870
 s. Using local postcards as examples\, we will discuss how vintage postcar
 ds can be used for family history. The discussion includes identifying the
  types of postcards\, finding places to purchase\, storing\, and catalogin
 g them appropriately.\n\n Alice van Ommeren is an avid collector of vinta
 ge postcards\, which has led to many postcard projects and books\, includi
 ng Stockton in Vintage Postcards\, Yosemite's Historic Hotels and Camps\, 
 and Petaluma in Vintage Postcards.She has given many presentations on vint
 age postcards and their role in documenting social history.\n\n Meeting s
 tarts at 12:30 pm\, presentation starts at 1:00 pm PST\n\n FREE Via ZOOM\
 n\n Register at https://www.scgsonline.org\n\n Registration closes Friday
 \, May 15th
URL:https://www.scgsonline.org 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
