 ther you're interested checking out an electric vehicle or e-bike\, instal
 ling solar or battery storage\, or replacing gas appliances with cleaner\,
  more efficient electric models\, this event has you covered! Connect with
  experts\, explore available rebates and incentives\, and learn how to mak
 e your home and transportation cleaner and greener.\n\nAt the Expo\, you c
 an:\n\n\\- Get free advice from energy efficiency and electrification expe
 rts\n\n\\- Learn about rebates and incentives for energy efficiency and el
 ectrification projects\n\n\\- Watch live product demonstrations\n\n\\- Ask
