  online or at door\n\nPancake Brunch 2026\n\nSATURDAY\, MAY 16\, 2026\, 9a
 m-Noon\n\nOn campus @ PHCS\n\n1782 PLEASANT HILL RD.  Sebastopol\n\nSeba
 stopol's Pleasant Hill Christian School began in the summer of 1982 as a r
 esult of the vision of two experienced and credentialed teachers. It was t
 heir desire to provide children with a challenging and exciting atmosphere
  for acquiring knowledge that would be conducive to the development of Chr
 istian character and spiritual development.\n\nOur school is distinctive: 
 an intimate\, family-friendly environment where students are nurtured and 
 challenged to develop their God-given gifts through a quality classical ac
 ademic program. Additionally\, it is our desire that each child develop hi
 s/her abilities to the fullest: not only academically\, but also in charac
 ter. We welcome families from all backgrounds who have a desire for indivi
 dualized attention from teachers who care about the whole child.\n\nPleasa
 nt Hill students are engaged in a community where life-long learning is mo
 deled by our faculty. Because our students are participants rather than sp
 ectators\, leadership opportunities abound.
LOCATION:Pleasant Hill Christian School
URL:https://www.phcs.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
