BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Letting Go Art Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260516T120000
UID:2605115hSTc8PrEkaYflCWPdcsCA
DESCRIPTION:A creative reset for your mind\, body\, and intuition\n\nThere
  comes a point where we realize we’ve been moving through life on autopi
 lot— disconnected from our inner voice\, our creativity\, and what we tr
 uly want.\n\nThis is your invitation to pause.\n\nThe Letting Go Art Exper
 ience is not a traditional art class.\n\nIt’s a guided\, immersive exper
 ience where art becomes a tool for release\, expression\, and reconnection
 .\n\nThrough a blend of art-making\, breath\, music\, movement\, and medit
 ation\,\n\nyou’ll be gently guided back into your body\, your senses\, a
 nd your creative flow.\n\nNo pressure. No expectations. No right or wrong.
 \n\nJust space—to explore\, to feel\, and to let go.
LOCATION:Mare Island Art Studios
URL:https://thelettinggoartexperience.com/sessions/the-letting-go-art-expe
 rience-may-session/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
