BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Judgment of Paris: The Grand Tasting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260517T170000
UID:260324FFgDLjMnPEurqjBbVmS8GA
DESCRIPTION:Taste Napa's Judgment of Paris victory! 50+ premier wines\, go
 urmet stations\, French-American flea market\, live entertainment\, and m
 uch more!\n\n**Fifty years ago\, Napa Valley shocked the world.** In 1976
 \, a blind tasting in Paris put American winemaking on the global map\, fo
 rever changing the course of wine history. Now\, half a century later\, we
  invite you to raise a glass to the legends\, the pioneers\, and the futur
 e of wine.\n\nJoin us in the heart of Napa Valley for a spectacular\, imme
 rsive four-hour Grand Tasting. Whether you are a devoted oenophile or simp
 ly looking for an unforgettable afternoon of world-class food\, culture\, 
 and entertainment\, this $250 all-access pass guarantees an experience of 
 a lifetime.\n\n**The Grand Tasting Wine Experience**\n\n**The 1976 JOP Fea
 tured:** Step back in time and taste history. This exclusive honors the l
 egendary winning wineries of the original Judgment of Paris\, offering a r
 are opportunity to sip the legacy that started it all.\n\n**50+ Premier Wi
 neries:** Embark on a tasting journey through more than 50 of the finest 
 estates\, showcasing the incredible diversity and world-class quality of m
 odern winemaking.\n\n**Culinary Excellence**\n\n**Gourmet Food Action Stat
 ions:** Watch Culinary Institute of America chefs in action as they prepa
 re mouth-watering\, freshly made bites designed to pair flawlessly with yo
 ur wine selections.\n\n**The Grove Experience:** Explore a vibrant\, bust
 ling area perfect for grabbing a gourmet bite\, relaxing in the shade\, an
 d mingling with both ticketed and walk-in guests.\n\n**Culinary Garden:**
  Wander through our lush\, interactive garden space where the flavors of 
 Napa come alive\, featuring fresh\, local ingredients and a lively\, open-
 air atmosphere.\n\n**A Transatlantic Festival of Arts & Entertainment**\n\
 n**French/American Flea Market:** Stroll through a curated\, vintage-insp
 ired market blending the rustic charm of a Parisian *marché aux puces* w
 ith classic Americana.\n\n**Live Entertainment Everywhere:** Feel the ene
 rgy of live musical performances by our DJ\, Bandjango\, who will be spinn
 ing the perfect soundtrack for a sunny Napa afternoon.\n\n**Street Perform
 ers:** Experience the whimsy of a transatlantic street fair with classic 
 American street performers roaming the grounds.\n\n**Secure your place in 
 wine history. You aren't just buying a ticket to a tasting\; you are stepp
 ing into a vibrant\, four-hour celebration of the exact moment Napa Valley
  became a global icon.**
LOCATION:CIA at Copia
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/judgment-of-paris-the-grand-tasting-ticke
 ts-1985403938626?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
