 tuary with aesthetic pruning\n\nexpert Michael Alliger and Osmosis founder
  Michael Stusser. They will share a detailed look at\n\nthe plantings and 
 pruning styles we have used to create Japanese style gardens over 40 years
 \n\nusing deer proof and drought resistant plantings suitable for our Cali
 fornia climate. The design\n\nintentions for the rock arrangements will be
