UID:26050846dKS8Z0CUCh5Kuui_jxEQ
DESCRIPTION:Shavuot Ice Cream Party\n\nCelebrate the holiday of Shavuot\, 
 commemorating the Giving of the Torah at Mt. Sinai 3\,337 years ago. Enjo
 y a scrumptious dairy buffet including cheesecakes\, a spectacular ice cre
