BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:INTO THE LIGHT: Light-filled aintings by Katy Boggs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T170000
UID:260501xvqDD-3cDESNI6HlnSFGhw
DESCRIPTION:Katy's paintings are an exploration of light—how it shapes f
 orm\, reveals color\, and defines what we see.\n\n"I am drawn to moments w
 here light is felt as much as seen: filtering through dense leaves\, tower
 ing in the crowns of trees\, glinting off cresting waves\, or softening in
 to the quiet glow of a sunset. Light is everywhere\; without it\, there is
  no seeing. Beyond its physical presence\, it also carries a deeper resona
 nce as a symbol of hope. In a time of uncertainty\, this work seeks to bri
 ng light into the image\, both visually and metaphorically."\n\nReception:
  April 25\, 4 to 6 pm.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lindsay Gang
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T000000
UID:260429fmCHCYhij0eRd2lOJOnswg
DESCRIPTION:Singer-songwriter\, Lindsay Gang\, was born and raised in Nort
 hern California. The traveling songbird’s experiences have taken her fro
 m the West Coast to the Midwest\, the East Coast\, and back. She makes sen
 se of the ebb and flow of life by turning her experiences and travels into
  song. She self-released her first two EPs\, Array of Color and Hanging On
 \, in 2022. With warm vocals\, lush guitar\, and tender\, heartfelt lyrics
 \, her songs possess the quality of exceptional fidelity\; they are reflec
 tive\, intimate\, and raw – echoing indie folk with a dreamy Americana f
 eel.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1038692684?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
