DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260524T193000
UID:260508epm0p7LgFUajxhjYSauHlw
DESCRIPTION:$15 General Admission\n\nDoors at 7:30pm. \n\nShow from 8:15-1
 0:30pm with one intermission\n\nEarlybirds!\n\n$3 off each ticket when you
  use the code earlybird17 at checkout. Offer ends May 17th.\n\nPromo C
 odes are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case sensitive\, b
 ut must be typed as one word.\n\nSpike’s love of singer-songwriters on t
 he jazzier side of folk & blues finds a unique outlet in The Get Real Gone
 . In addition to Spike on vocals & guitar\, the band features Dylan Juhan 
 on upright bass\, Mingo Lewis Jr. on percussion and Ray Fernandez on saxop
 hone. The acoustic framework allows them to create an organic music that i
 s a vibe unto itself. They released their self-titled debut in 2025\, a co
 llection of originals and a few choice covers from the world of jazz\, blu
 es\, and poetry. https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC3rxVIMq-455o8kD7yTIoEg 
 https://awesomehotcakes.com/ Recommended If You Like: Tim Buckley\, Jayne 
 Cortez\, Richie Havens
