UID:260502-HQqqaiAhEi9vm8ey6ZLjQ
DESCRIPTION:Embark on a magical mussel foraging adventure along the Sonoma
  Coast. Learn how to sustainably harvest\, clean\, and prepare fresh Calif
 ornia mussels while gaining insight into the region's coastal history\, in
 tertidal ecosystem\, and responsible stewardship of the land and sea. Afte
 r gathering your bounty\, enjoy a beachside feast featuring freshly forage
 d mussels-the perfect setting to ask questions\, share discoveries\, and s
 avor the ocean views. If you've never tasted mussels straight from the sea
 \, you're in for an unforgettable treat. Each participant may take home up
  to 10 pounds of fresh mussels\, along with recipes and preparation tips. 
 Mussel season ends in April\, so don't miss this unique coastal experience
 .
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/mussel-forage-feast-at-bodega-bay-2026-05
 -16/
