 Drop-In\n\n$30\n\nGet your hands dirty in this fun\, exploratory class whe
 re you’ll learn ceramics techniques. Both hand building and wheel throwi
 ng are options.If you’re signing up more than one child\, please email m
 elissa@sonomacommunitycenter.org for a sibling discount.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/clay-series-for-homeschoole
 rs-with-lexi/2026-05-14/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
