BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2nd Annual Voces y Pasos: A Cultural Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260528T190000
UID:260129rHIX8jDdtECfjDVlW5tpEQ
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the rich cultural traditions of Mexico through the v
 ibrant artistry of the musicians and dancers in LBC’s afterschool Marich
 i and Ballet Folklórico programs at Voces y Pasos \\(Voices and Steps\\)
 : A Cultural Celebration. Featuring more than 150 of Sonoma County’s tal
 ented youth\, Voces y Pasos brings these traditions and celebrations to 
 life in an unforgettable stage performance that pays tribute to their Mexi
 can heritage.\n\nLBC’s Mariachi Ensemble and its sister program\, LBC’
 s Ballet Folklórico\, enroll students from all over the county. Together 
 they deliver stunning performances that blend technical skill\, stage pres
 ence\, and heartfelt expression while embodying the grace and vibrancy of 
 traditional Mexican folk music and dance.\n\nThe young performers in these
  programs devote themselves to weekly rehearsals and regular performances 
 at community events that continue to shape them into impressive artists. T
 hanks to the generosity of our donors and sponsors\, they can participate 
 at no cost to their families\, with all equipment and costumes provided. J
 oin us for an inspiring evening that shines the spotlight on the voices an
 d steps of these talented students and honors the enduring power of cultur
 e\, tradition\, and community.
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts
URL:https://lutherburbankcenter.org/event/voces-y-pasos26/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Live Music Happy Hour - Collaboration Jazz Band - 4th Thursdays!
