SUMMARY:Pasta Class - Pasta Duos
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260529T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260529T210000
UID:260306MxGvcdqFMUCgqTAsktB5Vw
DESCRIPTION:Explore the beauty of contrast with the art of pasta duos - a 
 technique that joins two uniquely flavored or colored doughs into one stun
 ning piece. Learn how to roll\, layer\, and shape pastas that blend color 
 and taste in perfect harmony\, resulting in ribbons and patterns that are 
 both eye-catching and delicious. Event Details: Includes: Pasta dinner by 
 Chef River with curated wine pairings Timing: 4 hour class \\*Please note 
 this will require long periods of standing on hard floors. Theme: Duo past
 a making with flavored or colored doughs and fillings Availability: Extrem
 ely limited - only 10 seats available Club Members: Discount applies at ch
 eckout Dress Code: Casual\, closed-toe shoes Dietary Restrictions: We glad
 ly accommodate food allergies with advance notice so our guests can dine c
 omfortably and safely. We are unable to accommodate dairy\, gluten free or
  personal dietary preferences. Age Requirement: 21\\+ only Pets: Not permi
 tted at this event
