BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Petite Landscapes in Acrylic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T000000
UID:260509vcgvAvK6zE2MfFzKWuBjzw
DESCRIPTION:Schedule\n\nSaturday\, May 30\, 2026 10:00 AM – 2:00 PM\n\nL
 ocation\n\nRoom 208\n\nExperience Level\n\nBeginning\n\nEvent Categories: 
 Drawing & Painting\, Workshops\n\nAge\\(s\\)\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistrati
 on Cost:\n\n$65\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$20\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$8
 5\n\nLearn to create small abstract landscapes with acrylics on wooden til
 es using a limited palette\, blending techniques\, and unique tools. Begin
 ners welcome!\n\nAbout the Class\n\nHave you always wanted to paint landsc
 apes but don’t know where to start? Or are you curious about acrylics bu
 t haven’t taken the plunge yet? In this class\, you’ll learn a simple 
 technique to create small\, abstract landscapes on 5” square wooden tile
 s using a limited palette of colors. You’ll be guided through the basics
  of acrylic paints and mediums\, including surface preparation\, color ble
 nding with a flat bristle brush\, and using different tools to add texture
  and detail. By the end of the class\, you’ll apply a final coat of medi
 um to seal and protect your artwork\, leaving you with 2-3 completed piece
 s to take home\, along with a little easel to display your favorite one. T
 his class is perfect for beginners\, though some prior painting experience
  is helpful. The process you’ll learn can easily be applied to larger pa
 intings or even collage projects. All materials are provided. Feel free to
  bring snacks or a bag lunch to eat while you work.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/petite-landscapes-in-acryli
 c-3/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
