DESCRIPTION:MAMMA MIA! tells the story of Sophie\, a young woman on a Gree
 k island\, who invites three men\, all former boyfriends of her mother\, D
 onna\, to her wedding\, hoping to discover which one is her father. The mu
 sical utilizes the popular songs of the Swedish pop group ABBA to drive th
 e plot and explore themes of love\, family\, and identity.
