 is music feels familiar and fresh. Michael Fecskes \\(cello\\)\, a classic
 ally trained cellist and composer\, adds a unique depth to the group's sou
 nd. His compositions are rich and soulful. Together\, they form The Northe
 rn Still\, a dynamic acoustic/folk-pop trio. Since 2021 they've combined t
