BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Horses and Healers
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260530T153000
UID:260422XenSFTyZ_k28dakJnuyFCg
DESCRIPTION:**Horses & Healers: Equine-Assisted Experiential Methods for S
 trengthening Clinical Presence**\n\n**Novato\, California — May 30th** 
 — *Horses & Healers: Equine-Assisted Experiential Methods for Strengthen
 ing Clinical Presence* will take place on **May 30th from 9:30am to 3:30pm
  in Novato\, California**\, hosted by Heart & Mind Equine.\n\nThis in-pers
 on workshop is designed for medical\, mental health\, and holistic profess
 ionals seeking to strengthen clinical presence through experiential learni
 ng with horses.\n\nParticipants will engage in guided\, ground-based inter
 actions with horses to explore clinical presence\, attunement\, communicat
 ion\, and relational awareness. Horses provide real-time feedback to human
  emotional states and nonverbal communication\, offering an experiential a
 pproach to professional development.\n\nNo horse experience is required.\n
 \n**Event Details**\n\n**Event:** Horses & Healers: Equine-Assisted Experi
 ential Methods for Strengthening Clinical Presence\n\n**Date:** May 30\n\n
 **Time:** 9:30 AM – 3:30 PM\n\n**Location:** Novato\, California\n\n**Ho
 st:** Heart & Mind Equine\n\nFor more information or to register\, visit: 
 https://heart-mind-equine.mykajabi.com/horses-and-healers
LOCATION:Heart Mind Equine Horse Rescue
URL:https://heart-mind-equine.mykajabi.com/horses-and-healers
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
