DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma County Bicycle Coalition is excited to present Peda
 l Fest in celebration of Bike Month. This free family festival will featur
 e vendors\, demos\, community rides\, races & relays and general bike fun 
 for all!\n\nThe day will start at 10:30 with a bike decoration station fol
 lowed by a Kidical Mass family ride at 11:00\; there will also be group ri
 des from Petaluma\, Santa Rosa\, and other locations.\n\nContests will inc
 lude the longest wheelie\, the longest trackstand\, turtle races \\(how sl
 ow can you go?\\)\, and more!\n\nMultiple bike shops\, clubs\, and teams w
 ill be represented...with LOTS of cool bikes and swag to check out! Food a
 nd beverages available at Old Caz.\n\nOur Presenting Sponsor is SOMO Villa
 ge\, with additional support from Marin Bikes\, Old Caz\, and the Bay Area
  Air Quality District.
LOCATION:SOMO Village\, outside Old Caz Brewing
URL:https://www.bikesonoma.org/events/2026-bike-expo/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
