UID:260403q7wB5TQPAEO7TRQcRW32uw
DESCRIPTION:Renew: A Sustainable Culinary Celebration is a spring fundrai
 ser supporting Sonoma Family Meal’s work at Unity Kitchen. Join us for a
  relaxed evening featuring creative\, globally inspired bites made from up
 cycled ingredients—prepared by our teen culinary program students in col
 laboration with local chefs—alongside favorites from our Sabor food truc
 k.\n\nEnjoy local wine and beer\, live music\, lawn games\, and an excitin
 g raffle\, while learning how we’re reducing food waste\, training the n
 ext generation\, and addressing food insecurity across Sonoma Valley.\n\nC
 ome connect\, celebrate\, and help sustain and grow this work.
LOCATION:Harrows Barn at Cornerstone
URL:http://www.sonomafamilymeal.org/renewevent
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
