BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flavors of Film Series takes you to France with Hugo!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260531T163000
UID:260216mMzPP7gLMkSLPx07z_inog
DESCRIPTION:The family-favorite Flavors of Film: Family Series returns wit
 h a brand-new global twist! This season\, we invite you to join us every f
 ourth Sunday from February 22 through May 31 to explore different cultu
 res and corners of the world through a curated lineup of exciting films a
 nd interactive\, food-based experiences that bring each movie to life. 
 \n\nOur last stop of this global culinary journey concludes in France with
  the enchanting film\, *Hugo*. Following the film\, there will be hand
 s-on activities inspired by French culture and cuisine\, offering a though
 tful and delicious finale to the series. It’s a memorable way to wrap 
 up this worldwide adventure—perfect for curious minds and adventurous pa
 lates.
LOCATION:CIA at Copia
