 an 11-person body responsible for governing the library. Commissioners are
  appointed by the cities in Sonoma County and the county Board of Supervis
 ors. The commission establishes policy\; sets goals and objectives\; hires
  and evaluates the director\; establishes and monitors the annual budget\;
  and exercises such other powers\, consistent with the law to foster the e
 ffective use and management of the library. The commission generally meets
  monthly\, with additional special meetings as needed. Meetings are open t
 o the public and recordings are accessible online through
LOCATION:Rohnert Park-Cotati Library
