DESCRIPTION:This is your chance to stand shoulder to shoulder with winemak
 ing visionaries\, taste some of the world’s greatest wines and stake you
 r claim in something truly special before anyone else. With more than 100
  vintner offerings available\, the Napa Valley Barrel Auction is a truly s
 howstopping experience that defies comparison.\n\nIn an atmosphere charged
