DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260606T000000
UID:260227QF08j9oxiE-XLJ-QdaCCKA
DESCRIPTION:Elephant Revival’s music is like weather systems meeting in 
 the sky\, Bonnie’s warmly haunting voice either merging with the rhythms
  and melodies of the band or providing a counterpoint and transforming it.
  \n\nThey are a unique collection of multi-instrumentalists blending eleme
 nts of Celtic\, Americana\, Folk and Indie Art Rock\;\n\nBonnie Paine \\(v
 ocals\, cello\, djembe\, washboard\, musical saw and stomp box\\) Bridget 
 Law \\(fiddles\, vocals\\)\, Dango Rose \\(upright bass\, mandolin\, vocal
 s\\)\, Darren Garvey \\(drums\, percussion\, vocals\\).
